{"id":3361,"title":{"romaji":"Osananajimi ga Zettai ni Makenai Love Comedy","english":"Osamake: Romcom Where The Childhood Friend Won't Lose","native":"幼なじみが絶対に負けないラブコメ"},"slug":"osananajimi_ga_zettai_ni_makenai_love_comedy","synopsis":"My childhood friend Shida Kuroha seems to have feelings for me. She lives next door, and is small and cute. With an outgoing character, she’s the caring Onee-san type, this being one of her greatest strengths.\n\n…But, I already have my first love, the beautiful idol of our school, and the award-winning author high school girl, Kachi Shirokusa! Thinking about it rationally, I should have no chances with her, but, while walking home from school, she only talks to me, with a smile even! I might actually have a chance, don’t you think?!\n\nOr so I thought, but then I heard that Shirokusa already has a boyfriend, and my life took a turn for the worse. I want to die. Why is it not me?! Even though she was my first love…As I was drowning in despair and depression, Kuroha whispered.\n\n—If it’s that tough for you, then how about we get revenge? The best revenge ever, that is~","format":"TV","season":"SPRING","year":2021,"createdAt":"2021-04-15 08:11:19","updatedAt":"2021-04-15 10:37:30","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":43007},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":124675},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":43966},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":15756},{"site":"ANN","externalId":23945},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":15833},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":7253,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/ZMMxPuqX82AMr05Ue9vrUfFrJZVevG5WHEVA2FGl.jpg"},{"id":7254,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/qOWeAIHJFIrxjnQExSDZyJro3GcNO0IVIWeGUUOh.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":4,"name":"Doga Kobo","slug":"doga_kobo"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":10206,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":1